libva-v4l2-iris (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging. The driver, the msm_drv_video.so alias libva
    resolves by DRM name, the shared node rule, the three diagnostic commands
    and the install provenance manifest come from scripts/install-system.sh,
    the same path the Fedora spec and the Arch PKGBUILD use.

